  "description": "Splash Burst Font is a bold and playful paint splatter display font designed to add energy and attitude to your designs. With its splash, drip, and splatter style, this font is perfect for t-shirts, posters, kids’ projects, graffiti designs, sports graphics, and creative branding.\nThis font includes uppercase letters and numbers only, making it ideal for strong headlines, logos, and statement designs.\nGreat for:\n✔ T-shirt and merchandise designs\n✔ Posters and flyers\n✔ Streetwear & graffiti art\n✔ Kids designs\n✔ Stickers & decals\n✔ Cricut & Silhouette projects\n✔ Social media graphics\n• Files are compatible with Canva, Cricut Design Space, Silhouette Studio, Photoshop, Illustrator, Procreate, and more",
